<h2>🔍 FAQ</h2>
<h3>Q: Which API is best for production?</h3>
<p>A: <strong>OpenAI</strong> for English quality, <strong>DeepSeek</strong> for China/cost, <strong>Together AI</strong> for open-weight models.</p>
<h3>Q: Can I avoid lock-in?</h3>
<p>A: Yes. Use <strong>FreeModel</strong> or <strong>OpenRouter</strong> to route to any provider through one API.</p>
